@startuml dfd-2-list-contracts
!include _skin.puml
title DFD mức 2 — 5.0 Danh sách hợp đồng
caption ListContracts — GET /api/v1/contracts

actor "ContractListScreen\n/ App.jsx" as UI
rectangle "5.1\nGác cổng JWT\n(1.3)" as Gate
rectangle "5.2\nListContracts.execute" as List
database "D1.2 uploaded_contracts" as UC

UI --> Gate : GET /api/v1/contracts\nAuthorization: Bearer
Gate --> List : user_id
List --> UC : SELECT * WHERE user_id = ?\nORDER BY created_at DESC
UC --> List : rows (contract_id, filename,\nstatus, chunk_count, created_at, …)
List --> UI : { contracts: [...] }

note right of UI
  Mở HĐ cũ: màn hình gọi
  ``analyzeContract`` (3.0) — nếu đã có
  analysis thì 3.3 trả cache, không chạy LLM.
  Tải HĐ mới: 2.0 rồi 3.0.
end note

@enduml
